"Syl slew the alicorn king and devoured his prince and princess inside her rift."
"Syl's Dungeon CUBE drank Glimmerock's essence as the alicorn king died."
"Syl destroyed Azulean and slew its mermen king and queen with her own stored lightning."
"The mermen king and queen had kept each other sane by rivalry, with only years left."
"The surviving Vaelyssan mermen sense Syl anywhere and attack her in blind rage."
"Mermen infiltrators have lived among humans for years, holding classes and Emblems."
"Some infiltrators were not sirens at all, but other castes with the Infiltrator mutation."
"A siren who fails to win her chosen human loses Beguile and sinks into madness."
"The siren Vanessa renounced the mermen and lives on Tanglebay, devoted to Sylvain."
"Mermen workers stole the deepstone said to be lost to refining, 60 percent of each load."
"As Grand Shaman Slyz, Syl cowed Garz; the scarred, one-eared chieftain hates her."
"Syl took the goblin crafter Yuzz, the chef Glooz and others to live on Tanglebay."
"Yuzz is a level 42 Omnicrafter with an Emblem, the goblins' unofficial leader there."
"Leon stole dungeon bricks from the Abyssal Temple and built a fortress, V-Fort-001."
"V-Fort-001 blew itself up; Syl and Vee filled its crater and built Tanglebay there."
"Leon's crab shell holds dungeon brick; it cannot be broken, and blocks teleports near it."
